# Task 5: resolve_analytics_source replaces resolve_spark_source

## Context

Analytics source resolution used to branch per engine (Delta, Lakebase managed_synced, Lakebase app_managed, Neo4j/Cypher) and refused Neo4j and app_managed Lakebase outright. The new design reads only the R2RML-mapped `…_data` Unity Catalog table that the Build step materialises for every backend. Engine type is irrelevant to analytics.

## Changes

1. `src/back/core/graph_analysis/JobMetrics.py` — Deleted `resolve_spark_source` and `_lakebase_uc_source`; added `resolve_analytics_source(domain, settings)` which delegates to `SQLHelpers.effective_databricks_table`; added `domain`/`settings` kwargs to `JobMetrics.__init__`; updated `compute` to call new resolver; updated module docstring.
2. `src/back/core/graph_analysis/__init__.py` — Swapped `resolve_spark_source` → `resolve_analytics_source` in both import and `__all__`.
3. `src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py` — Replaced `resolve_spark_source(store, graph_name)` call in `_analytics_job_status` with `resolve_analytics_source(domain, settings)`; updated import and comments.
4. `tests/units/core/test_job_metrics.py` — Added two new TDD tests; deleted `TestResolveSparkSource` class and 10 tests for removed functionality; deleted `test_unreachable_graph_raises_with_the_reason`; added `_patch_source` autouse fixture to `TestJobMetricsCompute`.
5. `tests/units/dtwin/test_analytics_job_status.py` — Updated `resolve_spark_source` patch targets to `resolve_analytics_source`.

## Modified Files

- `src/back/core/graph_analysis/JobMetrics.py`
- `src/back/core/graph_analysis/__init__.py`
- `src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py`
- `tests/units/core/test_job_metrics.py`
- `tests/units/dtwin/test_analytics_job_status.py`

